guide forever/reputation/darnassus
title Darnassus Reputation
category Reputation
folder Reputation · Cities
faction Alliance
levels 12-60
zone Teldrassil
keywords Darnassus, Raedon Duskstriker, cloth quartermaster, Craftsmen's Terrace, Additional Runecloth, Wool, Silk, Mageweave, Runecloth, nightsaber, Swift Frostsaber, grey quests, Shadowglen, Dolanaar, Auberdine, Morrowgrain, Un'Goro Soil, Evergreen Pouch, Mathrengyl Bearwalker, The True Masters
reward text Exalted with Darnassus: in Classic, other races may buy the nightsabers
reward text Morrowgrain to Darnassus: 50 reputation for every 10 Morrowgrain, as often as you like
reward text About 3,700 Darnassus reputation from low-level quests in Teldrassil and Darkshore (in Classic, a fifth of it at 60)
why Cloth, Morrowgrain and the Teldrassil and Darkshore hubs: the quests pay most while you level.

# Built from Forever's quest data (the reputation each quest pays, as Forever's
# quest pages give it), quests.json, npcs.json and items.json (givers, drops,
# farm spots), and the Forever client tables (Faction: Night Elves start at
# 4000, Humans, Dwarves and Gnomes at 3100, Alliance Skyborne at 500;
# ItemSparse: no item needs Darnassus standing, and the nightsabers carry no
# reputation requirement in the client).
# Numbers: the first donation of each cloth pays 150 (60 cloth); Additional
# Runecloth (7801) pays 50 for 20 Runecloth and repeats. Bands: Friendly 6000,
# Honored 12000, Revered 21000. Morrowgrain to Darnassus (3803) pays 50 for 10
# Morrowgrain and repeats, after the Morrowgrain research chain (3763-3785).
# Low-level quests: in Classic a quest 6+ levels below you pays a fifth less per
# level, down to a fifth; one Forever beta report saw full pay at level 30.
# The quest hubs are optional: each hub's first step carries a label, the
# steps after it run only when it was done (`when done`), so skipping the
# first step skips the hub. The Crown of the Earth chain is left out: its
# phials are filled at moonwells, slow for its reputation.
# Level 54-60 first: The True Masters from Morgan's Vigil to Lakeshire
# (4182, 4183: 175, level 54) and the Morrowgrain chain (3763-3785: 220,
# level 50) that opens Morrowgrain to Darnassus. Left to a tip: Erelas
# Ambersky's wildkin chain (3661, 978, 979, 4901: 325), Ancient Spirit
# (4261: 150, after a long Felwood chain), Glyphed Oaken Branch (4986: 100),
# Put Her Down (Upper Blackrock Spire, 100) and Nefarian's head (200 to every
# Alliance city).
# ASSUMED: other races buy the nightsabers at Exalted with Darnassus (Classic
# flow; Forever's data has no vendor rule for it). In-game check: Lelanai's
# stock for a non-Night Elf at Exalted and below.
# Morrowgrain: the world database's loot table for the Evergreen Herb Casing
# holds Morrowgrain 37% of the time, 1 to 5 of it (about 1.1 a casing).
# ASSUMED: the Evergreen Pouch can be used once every 10 minutes (Classic;
# Forever's data has no cooldown for it). In-game check: the pouch's cooldown
# after one use.
# INGAME: grey-quest rep at 60 (Classic: a fifth from 9 levels below; one Forever beta report: full, quest 456 at level 30 paid 100)
# INGAME: reputation discount (Classic: 10% at Honored with the vendor's faction; Forever guide sites report 5% at Friendly rising to 20% at Exalted, another says unannounced). Check a city vendor's price at Friendly and at Honored.
# Legacy Diplomat adds up to 10% to every gain; the numbers here leave it out.
# No race has a reputation bonus in Forever (Diplomacy is gone).

step Raedon Duskstriker, the cloth quartermaster
  zone Darnassus
  tip Raedon Duskstriker takes cloth for Darnassus; he stands in the Craftsmen's Terrace, in the north-east of Darnassus, by the tailors. Each first donation of 60 Wool, Silk, Mageweave and Runecloth pays 150 reputation once; after the Runecloth one, Additional Runecloth pays 50 for every 20 Runecloth, as often as you like. The Auction House in the Tradesmen's Terrace is the quickest source of cloth. In Classic, quests pay full reputation while they are at most 5 levels below you, so do Teldrassil (levels 1-12), Darkshore (11-20) and Ashenvale (18-30) while you level through them. After the donations come The True Masters in the Burning Steppes and Morrowgrain, a second repeatable turn-in; then the optional hubs, best rate first: Shadowglen (about 35 a minute at full value), Dolanaar (28), Auberdine (23). Every Darnassus gain also gives a quarter as much to Stormwind, Ironforge and the Gnomeregan Exiles, except quests in the level 1-10 start areas. Legacy Diplomat adds up to 10% to every gain.
  level 12
  collect 2592 x60 nearest            -- Wool Cloth: furbolgs, satyrs and naga in Darkshore and Ashenvale
  accept 7792
  turnin 7792

step A Donation of Silk
  tip Silk Cloth drops from humanoids level 23 to 40: the satyrs and furbolgs of Ashenvale, the Thistlefur and Foulweald camps, the Grimtotem of Stonetalon.
  level 26
  collect 4306 x60 nearest
  accept 7798
  turnin 7798

step A Donation of Mageweave
  tip Mageweave Cloth drops from humanoids level 35 to 50: the Hatecrest naga and Gordunni ogres of Feralas, the Dunemaul ogres of Tanaris.
  level 40
  collect 4338 x60 nearest
  accept 7799
  turnin 7799

step A Donation of Runecloth
  tip Runecloth drops from humanoids level 50 and up: the Deadwood furbolgs of Felwood, the Winterfall furbolgs of Winterspring, the Scourge cultists of the Plaguelands. Keep any Runecloth past the first 60 for Additional Runecloth.
  level 50
  collect 14047 x60 nearest
  accept 7800
  turnin 7800

step Morgan's Vigil: Dragonkin Menace
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip Helendis Riverhorn at Morgan's Vigil, in the south-east of the Burning Steppes, starts The True Masters: 175 Darnassus reputation for two quests (level 54: in Classic 140 at 60), and the chain goes on to Stormwind Keep for 175 Stormwind. The Black Broodlings and the Black Drake live on the slopes north of the Vigil; the Black Dragonspawn and Black Wyrmkin west of it, in the middle of the zone.
  level 55
  accept 4182                         -- Dragonkin Menace, +100
  kill 7047 x15 quest 4182.1          -- Black Broodling
  kill 7040 x10 quest 4182.2          -- Black Dragonspawn
  kill 7044 quest 4182.3              -- Black Drake
  kill 7041 x4 quest 4182.4           -- Black Wyrmkin
  turnin 4182
  accept 4183                         -- The True Masters, +75

step Lakeshire: Magistrate Solomon
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip Magistrate Solomon waits in the town hall of Lakeshire; his next quest takes you to Stormwind Keep (the Stormwind guide follows it). Other Darnassus quests at this level, for when you pass by: Erelas Ambersky in Rut'theran Village has a wildkin chain into Winterspring (325 in all, with Ranshalla's escort), Arei's escort in Felwood pays 150 after the Emerald Sanctuary's chain, Mulgris Deepriver at the Writhing Haunt in the Western Plaguelands 100 for the Glyphed Oaken Branch, and Put Her Down in Upper Blackrock Spire 100 with a group.
  turnin 4183

step Morrowgrain (optional)
  label dn-morrowgrain
  zone Darnassus
  tip Morrowgrain to Darnassus takes 10 Morrowgrain for 50, as often as you like, and pays in full at 60. The chain before it is level 50 (in Classic a fifth at 60): 220 at full. Innkeeper Saelienne sends you to Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm in the Cenarion Enclave; he wants 20 Un'Goro Soil. (The innkeepers of Stormwind and Ironforge give the same start.)
  accept 3763                         -- Assisting Arch Druid Staghelm, +10
  turnin 3763                         -- Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm
  accept 3764                         -- Un'Goro Soil, +100

step Un'Goro Crater: Un'Goro Soil
  when done dn-morrowgrain
  zone Un'Goro Crater
  tip Dig Un'Goro Soil from the dirt mounds all over the crater; most of the crater's beasts and the Gorishi silithids drop it too, about one kill in three. Take far more than 20: every pouch use takes 2, about 18 for each 10 Morrowgrain.
  collect 11018 x20 quest 3764.1      -- Un'Goro Soil

step Darnassus: Morrowgrain Research
  when done dn-morrowgrain
  zone Darnassus
  tip Jenal, beside Fandral in the Cenarion Enclave, takes the soil. Mathrengyl Bearwalker sells the Evergreen Pouch and Packets of Tharlendris Seeds. With a seed packet and 2 Un'Goro Soil in your bags, use the pouch to grow an Evergreen Herb Casing and open it: about one casing in three holds Morrowgrain (1 to 5), the rest other herbs. The pouch works once every 10 minutes, so use it whenever it is ready while you do other things.
  turnin 3764                         -- Jenal
  accept 3781                         -- Morrowgrain Research, +10
  turnin 3781                         -- Mathrengyl Bearwalker
  accept 3785                         -- Morrowgrain Research, +100
  buy 11020 npc 4217                  -- Evergreen Pouch
  buy 11022 x10 npc 4217              -- Packet of Tharlendris Seeds
  collect 11040 x10 quest 3785.1 @35.4,8.4 -- Morrowgrain: grow it here and open the casings
  turnin 3785

step Morrowgrain to Darnassus
  when done dn-morrowgrain
  tip Every 10 Morrowgrain: 50 reputation at Mathrengyl Bearwalker. Keep the pouch and buy seeds as you go. It is slow: about 9 casings, 90 minutes of pouch waits, 18 Un'Goro Soil and 9 seed packets for each hand-in, a little over 30 reputation an hour, so run it beside the Runecloth. Quintis Jonespyre at Feathermoon Stronghold in Feralas takes Morrowgrain at the same rate, 25 for 5, after his own quest.
  collect 11040 x10 optional @35.4,8.4 -- Morrowgrain
  turnin 3803 direct optional         -- Mathrengyl Bearwalker: Morrowgrain to Darnassus, +50

